#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:2
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Dashboard is a single, high-level view into your environment which "
"includes easy-to-read performance and configuration information. In many "
"cases other areas within |morpheus| UI will allow you to drill deeper "
"into the information presented in the dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:6
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:6
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch 7.16+ is required for the Log Trends Dashboard panel to "
"work. When using versions below 7.16 you will see error messages in logs "
"due to this panel missing needed dependencies to work correctly but these"
" errors may be safely ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:8
msgid ".. image:: /images/operations/dashboard1.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:10
msgid "**Environment**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:12
msgid "**Groups:** Total number of Groups currently created"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:13
msgid "**Clouds:** Total number of Clouds currently integrated"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:14
msgid "**Clusters:** Total number of clusters currently provisioned"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:15
msgid "**Apps:** Total number of Apps currently provisioned"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:16
msgid "**Instances:** Total number of Instances currently provisioned"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:17
msgid "**Users:** Total number of |morpheus| user accounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:19
msgid "**System Status**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:21
msgid ""
"System status gives a high-level view of the health of the appliance. "
"More detailed information can be viewed on the appliance health detail "
"page (|AdmHea|) and a more detailed breakdown of the meaning of each "
"status indicator is in |morpheus| `health documentation "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/health/health.html>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:23
msgid "**Favorites**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:25
msgid ""
"Any Instances you've \"favorited\" will appear here along with the "
"Instance name, type, and IP address"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:27
msgid "**Alarms**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:29
msgid ""
"The most recent five Alarms are displayed here and the user may link "
"through to the resource which triggered the Alarm. For the complete list "
"of Alarms and more information on each Alarm navigate to |OpeActAla|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:31
msgid "**Instance Status**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:33
msgid ""
"The total number of Instances is listed along with a pie chart showing "
"the statuses of each. Hover over each section of the pie chart to see the"
" total number and percentage of Instances in that state. States may "
"include running, stopped, provisioning, and more"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:35
msgid "**Instances By Cloud**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:37
msgid ""
"The total number of Clouds which currently have an Instance provisioned "
"is shown. Hover over each section of the pie chart to see the total "
"number and percentage of Instances provisioned to each Cloud"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:39
msgid "**Daily Cloud Instances**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:41
msgid ""
"The number of Instances that have existed at any point in the day with "
"additional breakdown to show the number provisioned to each Cloud. This "
"number will include any pre-existing Instances which have carried over "
"from previous days along with any new Instances that were provisioned and"
" existed on that day even for a short time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:43
msgid "**Group Workloads**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:45
msgid ""
"The instantaneous count of host or container records broken down by Group"
" association"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:47
msgid "**Cloud Workloads**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:49
msgid ""
"The instantaneous count of host or container records broken down by Cloud"
" association"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:51
msgid "**Cluster Workloads**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:53
msgid ""
"The instantaneous count of managed containers broken down by Cluster "
"association"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:55
msgid ".. image:: /images/operations/dashboard2.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:57
msgid "**Log History**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:59
msgid ""
"Log History shows a snapshot of various time segments throughout the "
"current day and the number of logs generated during each segment. Hover "
"over any bar on the graph to see a breakdown in severity of the logs "
"within each segment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:61
msgid "**Log Trends**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:63
msgid ""
"Log Trends identifies and lists repeated messages found in recent longs. "
"If desired, this view can be filtered to show only Error or Warning-level"
" log messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:65
msgid "**Job Executions**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:67
msgid ""
"Displays the number of successful and unsuccessful Job executions over "
"the last day, week or month"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:69
msgid "**Backups**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:71
msgid ""
"Displays the number of successful and unsuccessful backups over the last "
"day, week or month"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:73
msgid "**Task Executions**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:75
msgid ""
"Displays the number of successful and unsuccessful Task executions over "
"the last day, week or month"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:77
msgid "**Activity**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/dashboard.rst:79
msgid ""
"The activity list displays the last few events that have taken place in "
"|morpheus| by any user. This could be new provisioned workloads, deleted "
"workloads, backups, or a number of other things. A more complete list of "
"recent activities can be viewed in |OpeAct|"
msgstr ""

